MODULE: AdmissionIncoherentRow
TARGET: SampleCoherent
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: Read the old version with the byte-equal newer payload instead of one coherent raw row
PERTURBS: Confirm

--- FIND
    /\ sampled' = VisibleSource
--- REPLACE
    /\ sampled' = [VisibleSource EXCEPT ![1] = IF @ = Newer[1] THEN Row(Prepared[1].stamp,@.bytes,@.deleted) ELSE @]
--- END
